{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "641e0384d509b5f96831a5155a415702958f85ff95f816e5844d8fc195170041", "ja": "（麗花の初公演が、無事に終わった！\n今日は麗花と、今後の話し合いをする予定だが……）", "zh": "（丽花的首次公演顺利结束了！今天本来打算和丽花谈谈今后的安排，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "0632f9f9776e53228e0a37797aeed2177393962fb0658054fac6a0b2a0b50eca", "ja": "じゃーん！　お待たせしました、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "锵——！让你久等了，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "85ea646c3cac5ff1071df275d78c5ef079704b16cb9127919553f349b2449c52", "ja": "ああ麗花、お疲れさま。\n……って、なんで衣装を着てるんだ？", "zh": "啊，丽花，辛苦了。\n……等等，你怎么穿着演出服？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "c8b028610ba121501574906de38f7a76265a199af88b3ac63926ecf60e0da628", "ja": "え？　でも、次のお仕事の話をするんですよね？\n大丈夫ですよ、まかせてください！　ラララ～♪", "zh": "诶？可是，不是要说下一个工作的事吗？\n放心吧，交给我！啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "15b28bfdc77a1b35ec187aaabd2f82b218f06e5c3c93665dbf4df03952d6edb0", "ja": "うん、声の調子もバッチリです！　それで、\n開演は何時からですか？　盛り上がりましょうね！", "zh": "嗯，嗓子的状态也棒极了！话说回来，\n开演是几点开始呀？要好好嗨起来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1005_p", "source_sha256": "14590c0982ed5fa99eb838a413613e1426c8939c15dc7e454d31204557d1fb7d", "ja": "確かに、調子は良さそうだけど……。\n今日は話だけだから、ステージはないよ。", "zh": "确实，状态看起来不错，不过……\n今天只是来聊聊，没有上台表演哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "f34a519ed8d80dc4f5de470e72b9ee56f2e00a470b3c75e8106290332c27dc71", "ja": "あらら、そうなんですか？\n残念……。", "zh": "哎呀，是这样吗？\n真遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "6b15e7bbee3877b6616d3a3540ee0b7a89e64159046275058eb4977649bbbfa5", "ja": "あっ、でもでも！\nせっかくだし、衣装はこのまま着てていいですか？", "zh": "啊，不过不过！\n难得有这个机会，服装可以就这样继续穿着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4994650ef939055f3cc41a9a671292507d2dbb99feb6b682840b11c56575dc2b", "ja": "汚さないようにな！　……ええと、それで今日は、\n麗花の希望が聞きたいんだ。どんな仕事がしたいとか。", "zh": "注意别弄脏了！……那个，今天我想听听丽花的愿望。比如想做什么样的工作之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "aed3ff48596187f5eb76abace794d92a17972d28fc7c6ec8769dc5ad71e05f3f", "ja": "私の希望ですか？　それならもちろん、\nステージに出たいです！", "zh": "我的愿望吗？那当然是，\n想登上舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "1446967c32a5cfa77b8252e2344f0bb60665b8d74f15259329ae219a2d55b4e9", "ja": "この前の公演が、とっても楽しかったし。\nまた、みんなの前で歌いたいな～って！", "zh": "因为上次的演出特别开心。\n所以我想再在大家面前唱歌～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9d0adc69ba848d39b88678e2b122835eed22dca11bc230e3bba6f903b01d2859", "ja": "なるほど、ステージを中心に活動したい、と……。\n他に希望はないか？　どんな事でもいいんだけど。", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说，你想以舞台活动为主……  \n还有其他希望吗？什么都可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "3535423053b328a9ced59c06e7478f4ff126183f10296d9188c92cdd88013121", "ja": "なんでもいいんですか？　……あっ！　だったら、\n山のてっぺんに、劇場の2号店を作りたいかも？", "zh": "什么都可以吗？……啊！那样的话，我或许想在山顶建一座剧场的第2号分店？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "606671bb3b0ce50bfc87e38f4a79d777a562b8c72198f71960c7f81a1073a088", "ja": "劇場に来るだけで、綺麗な景色が見られますし！\nヤッホーって叫んだら、発声練習にもなりますよ♪", "zh": "只要来到剧场，就能看到美丽的景色！  \n喊一声“呀吼——”，还能顺便练习发声哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ddba5510f9d122563aa2854dfa64b7320dc1fd678ef80d2e06c11e96d0ae7464", "ja": "その希望は、社長に相談してみないとだな！\nところで麗花は、どんなアイドルになりたい？", "zh": "这个愿望，得先去跟社长商量一下才行啊！\n话说回来，丽花想成为怎样的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "581c18a54be29500dff39a2dd4dd5d13c7694a6497c2f33d7a9ce3c04bf43184", "ja": "どんなアイドルに、ですか？\nうーん……あっ！", "zh": "要成为怎样的偶像吗？\n嗯——……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "688adf35041747541ce7ca6ebfb441a5516ca7d2dc5e6f54e4006fce03ce6190", "ja": "はいはーい！　{$P$}さん、私、\nお母さんみたいになりたいかもしれません！", "zh": "好——好！{$P$}先生，我可能想成为妈妈那样的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d9183962e746e6e3d7b6f19d7b5b172f237dddcc3cb230b74f36175fb858ca82", "ja": "お母さんって、麗花の？\n……アイドルなのか？", "zh": "你说的妈妈，是丽花的妈妈吗？\n……她是偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "7fd8ce77ab8fedc53a6ccfa374b82e9a264f1957f7607494346c5acb4a74747e", "ja": "お母さんも歌を歌うのがお仕事ですけど、\nアイドルじゃありません！　オペラを歌う人なんです♪", "zh": "我妈妈的工作也是唱歌，不过她不是偶像！她是唱歌剧的歌手♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "77b9d482caf04f0fa62b2f9d50ea658f2dd1ecdb615d111ed40ca3b7e9b1ac8f", "ja": "オペラ……\n麗花のお母さんは、オペラ歌手なのか？", "zh": "歌剧……\n丽花的妈妈是歌剧演员吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "5790f7611f1c200928f60ec319a59e4afd2ff17e888d55bd28f9d972b5939ec9", "ja": "多分そうです！　ちなみにお父さんは、\nお母さんのお世話をするのがお仕事なんですよ♪", "zh": "大概是吧！顺便一提我爸爸的工作，\n就是照顾我妈妈哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "d3dcfae639f03c2e63df882adfd0065219d1278ddfd52b53304bb89542c753e5", "ja": "とっても普通の、優しい人です！　そういえば\n{$P$}さんに、ちょっと似てるかも？", "zh": "是个非常普通、很温柔的人！这么说来，或许和{$P$}先生有点像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1022_p", "source_sha256": "93891af45b236a6c52122121d807155bcf029bd4a4bff79f1e0c5da091b0f081", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。\nじゃあ麗花の歌は、お母さん譲りかな。", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。\n那么，丽花的歌声是遗传自妈妈的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "d12af378744c5c64c768fb31371d6c30d881f6705fe1e026895033257c573431", "ja": "お母さんのほうが、私よりずっと上手ですよ！\nそれに……。", "zh": "妈妈唱得比我好多了！\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "f12819eb833e146ec04b4cd63aedeb943655a70329c899811a0ecdaaed81d06f", "ja": "お母さんの歌は、聞いた人みんなを、\n幸せにしてくれるんです♪　えっへん！", "zh": "妈妈唱的歌，能让每个听到的人都感到幸福♪　嘿嘿！屿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1025_p", "source_sha256": "51a07ce917207c7d61d55c909c8fadcd63a9c5ec3e6df53e01859d5f84e7f6f9", "ja": "なるほど……。\n麗花は、そんなお母さんに憧れてるって事か。", "zh": "原来如此……。\n也就是说，丽花憧憬着那样的母亲吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "298da9891153d00fc37416292bd694ca3af1016390107f8d89416101add6901c", "ja": "はい♪　私、オペラには\nそんなに興味がなかったんですけど……。", "zh": "是的♪我以前对歌剧没那么感兴趣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "bc06ae1bad56400d831803ab714137f63d7f76a3b36d7db0893111f649303339", "ja": "でもでも、歌うのは大好きです♪　私もいつか\nお母さんみたいに、みんなを幸せにできたらいいな～。", "zh": "不过不过，我最喜欢唱歌了♪要是有一天，我也能像妈妈一样让大家幸福，那就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "39ecd39feb0a782beb9d13634c071776cf3938ec83937e3e2acfbb6192c0680c", "ja": "はは、麗花なら絶対にできるよ。\nそれじゃあ、歌の活動をメインにするとして……。", "zh": "哈哈，丽花的话肯定能做到。\n那么，就以歌唱活动为主……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "3e873fee18d4a5fb835a7f3982304c42d91a4cd3f3dda089068c37d452a3bdb6", "ja": "オペラだと、演劇の要素もあるよな。\nそういう仕事をしてみたいとか、希望はあるか？", "zh": "歌剧也包含戏剧元素。\n你有没有想尝试这类工作的想法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "13e2b33cb154f1045cf0b34f79bbf26bc3719d20e5e521b014cc482f9fddd546", "ja": "えっ！？　いいんですか？\nそういうの、やってみたいです♪", "zh": "诶！？真的可以吗？\n我想试试看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1032_p", "source_sha256": "ccf39ffe2c35bca6c904869d427002f80cad9deff940c709ebee857225fb2942", "ja": "えっ？　麗花、今のは……。", "zh": "咦？丽花，刚才那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "27e5299372678da3c11c735e5d44787ad02d3707ec373e3a5cd42f5721db7d1e", "ja": "今のは、お母さんの真似をしてみました！\nどうですか？　似てましたか？", "zh": "刚才那个，我试着模仿了一下妈妈！\n怎么样？像不像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1034_p", "source_sha256": "4b63846823be31ed528c82300f9b6ac37b3b2a850479ed4d21605bf5b0482ee4", "ja": "なるほど、オペラか……。お母さんに\n似てるかどうかはわからないけど、雰囲気は出てたよ！", "zh": "原来如此，是歌剧啊……虽然不知道像不像妈妈，不过确实唱出了那种感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1035_048rei", "source_sha256": "ecae90b0e79f750c6a6b6b0d35082e16356e00893a7c1e5be9147c78b10c5cec", "ja": "本当ですか？　わ～い、わ～い！\n歌うお仕事、たくさんできるといいな♪", "zh": "真的吗？　耶～太好了，太好了！\n要是以后能做很多唱歌的工作就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_004_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "0db1672738db4cb1e83952d39c9bbf01498b3ca0aaaba0840e0fdf624e375bd2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、これからも\n私のこと、よろしくお願いしますね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今后也请多多关照\n我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
